WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:02.610
Not every job is the same.

00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:07.370
So your AI sorts every call into three tiers.

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:11.050
Tier one: everyday jobs.

00:00:11.530 --> 00:00:13.550
They're booked straight into your calendar.

00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:16.950
Tier two: bigger jobs.

00:00:17.670 --> 00:00:20.870
It takes the details, and waits for your OK.

00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:24.250
“There's sparks coming out of my power point!”

00:00:24.950 --> 00:00:27.410
Tier three: emergencies.

00:00:27.970 --> 00:00:31.170
It skips the questions, and alerts you straight away.

00:00:32.450 --> 00:00:35.410
You choose which jobs go in each tier.
